sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as RM/Admin via controller
    participant SG as :SessionGuard
    participant RG as :RolesGuard
    participant Loan as :EquipmentRequestService
    participant DB as :PrismaService
    participant Time as :Clock
    participant History as :HistoryService
    Staff->>SG: canActivate(cookie)
    SG-->>Staff: Principal or 401
    Staff->>RG: authorize(principal,RM_or_Admin)
    RG-->>Staff: Allow or 403
    Note over Staff,Loan: Proceed only if both guards allow.
    Staff->>Loan: decide(requestId,decision,expectedVersion,actor)
    Loan->>DB: $transaction(currentDecision)
    Note over Loan,DB: Inside tx: lock resources row first, then read request and occupancy, recheck role, Pending, eligibility/occupancy.<br/>Approval: future pickup before unchanged returnDue, reserve and reject all competing Pending.<br/>Rejection: reason required, 1-500 characters. Borrower inactivity alone does not block approval.
    Loan->>Time: now()
    Time-->>Loan: serverNow
    alt Invalid input, stale state, lost authority or conflict
        Note over Loan,DB: 409 on stale version/state. Keep the competing committed result.
        DB-->>Loan: Failure with current authorized result
        Loan-->>Staff: Rejected action, no partial mutation
    else Eligible approval or valid rejection
        Loan->>History: append(decisionEvent,tx)
        History-->>Loan: Stored or failure
        Note over Loan,DB: Approval includes audit for winner and automatic competing rejections.<br/>Conditional state/version update. Append history for each successful transition.<br/>Commit state, reservation and history together.
        alt Write/history/commit fails
            DB-->>Loan: Rollback
            Loan-->>Staff: Failure, no false success
        else Transaction commits
            DB-->>Loan: Approved+reservation or Rejected+reason
            Loan-->>Staff: Decision and Collect before if approved
        end
    end
